{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/1t.gif?t=1744202359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>    Build \u00a0 a passionate hate for time wasting puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the kind of Game where you will either be Stuck in an Endless Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> of your own flawed Logic or stare mindlessly at a Screen with seemingly no </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>way to solve the Puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Its very Casual Fun for everyone to Enjoy and Relax!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Play Levels inspired by classic video game mechanics, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">only to realize the futility of your attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The reward? Cheerful situational humor,   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUELY IMAGINATIVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gameplay of <i>Brainrot </i>Parade 3 is wholly original, comprised of lavishly decorated Levels that players interact\u00a0 \u00a0 in imaginative ways to solve puzzles. Impeccably simple, yet satisfyingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GORGEOUSLY GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/okplanetUntitled_Project.gif?t=1744202359\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A NEW KIND OF STORYTELLING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>BrainRot Parade 3</i> isn't just a game - it's a work of art, expressing itself through soulful, charming Style and distinguished puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/Untitled_Projecjjt__1_.gif?t=1744202359\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Deception&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Typically means something appears or seems one way, but is actually different or the opposite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Deceit&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implies a more intentional act of misleading or betraying trust. It suggests a deliberate attempt to deceive or trick someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Brainrot</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refers to a state of thinking or reasoning that appears flawed, irrational, or unsound, but in a way that is insidious or difficult to detect. It describes a mental state that may seem coherent or logical on the surface, but is actually compromised by faulty logic or inherent biases.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552570?t=1744202359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552570?t=1744202359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/43a824e046f02672ccf3ef7d84add5fba15cb68e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744202359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/43a824e046f02672ccf3ef7d84add5fba15cb68e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744202359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552570/extras/1t.gif?t=1744